      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This indicates to me that the shapekeys or weight painting for the avatars that are experiencing this issue are broken. For example the avatar may have a vertice that is going further than expected resulting in different lighting when the shader tries to calculate lighting. \nIf you have access to any of the avatars that are experiencing this I can suggest first checking that the vertices affected by the shapekeys are moving as expected. If you can't find anything there you may also try uploading the avatar with a lighting anchor override.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
