      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This could be an issue with different meshes on an avatar using different light probes--if the face is closer to one light probe than the feet, for example.  Set all meshes \"anchor override\" in the mesh renderer to the face mesh gameobject.  That way all avatar parts will be using the same light settings.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
