  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-09-27T09:58:23.456Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have no idea what causes it, but it seems on certain characters (unsure of what makes a character behaves that way) when you activate a gesture like fist, your character will change light levels depending on the world, getting lighter or darker.\n\nI have tested it with different shaders, and it seems to be based on the model, also it seems to be local, even more confusing",
